{"total_count":2,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9813","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9813/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9813/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9813/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9813","id":6591158273,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRqP6Nw","number":9813,"title":"Prove L-meta-4791 by wrapping the smaller two-colour class","user":{"login":"client-ai20k","id":305322855,"node_id":"U_kgDOEjLbZw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/305322855?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/client-ai20k","html_url":"https://github.com/client-ai20k","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/client-ai20k/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/client-ai20k/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/client-ai20k/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/client-ai20k/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/client-ai20k/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/client-ai20k/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/client-ai20k/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/client-ai20k/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/client-ai20k/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-11-24T20:51:30Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:08:19Z","closed_at":"2026-11-24T23:08:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/9813","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9813","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9813.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9813.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Direct proof of L-meta-4791.\n\nConstruction: split the input wires read by gates into the two colour classes (wires with index < p vs >= p) and copy the smaller class through fresh AND gates (w AND w), then remap every gate input through the copy. The wrapped circuit computes the same function, has size at most 2 * C.size, and no OR gate reads wires of both colours, so tCount = 0. With 1 <= C.size, D.size + 4 <= 6 * C.size.\n\nVerified: lake build exit 0; verbatim statement check exit 0; local checker ACCEPTED (check), axioms [propext, Quot.sound, Classical.choice], kernel re-checked 1728 constants.\n\n**X handle**: @Nhatcuong22","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9813/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9813/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9414","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9414/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9414/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9414/events","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9414","id":6590353870,"node_id":"PR_kwDOV4BIxs8AAAABRpmW9Q","number":9414,"title":"Prove L-meta-4791 by reading one operand of every gate through an AND","user":{"login":"jackboykin","id":35545998,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTQ1OTk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35545998?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackboykin","html_url":"https://github.com/jackboykin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackboykin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackboykin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackboykin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackboykin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackboykin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackboykin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackboykin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackboykin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackboykin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-11-24T20:04:27Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:02:56Z","closed_at":"2026-11-24T23:02:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pulls/9414","html_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9414","diff_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9414.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/pull/9414.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Proves L-meta-4791: every fan-in-two AND/OR circuit has an equivalent one with no two-colour OR, here at exactly twice the size, so within 6s - 4 for every s >= 1.\n\nEach gate op(u, v) becomes two gates: a = AND(u, u), then op(a, v). An AND gate has empty OR-reach, so the OR-reach of an OR gate is the reach of its second operand alone. That is one input, or the reach of one earlier gate of the same shape, so by induction it never holds two inputs and cannot hold a point and a line.\n\nThe construction keeps the function at every input and does not use the hypothesis that the circuit is false at one-hot inputs. It also shows the class tCount = 0 is all circuits up to a factor of two, since the doubled operand is allowed by IsAO2.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9414/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-goat/pequalnp-proofs/issues/9414/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}